# A0: take production off the cards for the window: stop the rig node agent (its serving container stops with it), then remove
# any thatch-inference container (unserve). No status action here: the driver would flag production's container as stale.
# The placement record stays in the spine; A9 (agentstart) brings the same :latest back at the end of the window.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=agentstop unserve
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-next-2
